  unitName: Earth Knight Edea
  unitId: 30163
  unitNumber: 246
  description: "One of the four legendary warriors who fought to save the Kingdom
    of Palmyna, and commonly thought to have been Palmyna\u2019s princess in disguise.
    The bond she shared with her comrades in arms awakened the true potential within
    her. Her legendary emerald armor was actually a broadsword which turned into
    full body armor with a magical incantation. It is said to have drawn its powers
    from the earth."
  summonDesc: Onwards to our destiny!<br>There is no turning back.<br>May you cleave
    a path to greatness!
  fusionDesc: "The land\u2019s power is flowing into me.<br>H-Hey, cut it out!<br>You
    know I don\u2019t like showing my face!"
  evoDesc: "I\u2019m feeling great!<br>I really lucked out getting to be<br>your
    companion, huh?"
